      "title": "Scope",
      "content": "Scope: This Indian Standard (IS 2062 : 2011) covers and specifies requirements for Hot Rolled Medium and High Tensile Structural Steel - Specification (Seventh Revision). It applies to structural_steel_standard_quality under steel_metals category in the construction_civil domain.",
